# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime data.
#
# data/ holds the scientific source of truth (§24.3) for a live run: raw blobs,
# the append-only event store and derived tables. It is deliberately NOT
# committed. A study database can also contain vendor data that is not
# redistributable, which is why blob metadata carries a `redistributable` flag
# per source.
#
# There is no committed fixture directory, and no export command yet: the
# Phase 1 world is a closed-form function of a session index, so a clean
# checkout reproduces it byte for byte by running it (§32). A signed,
# hash-verified release bundle is Phase 3 work and is not claimed here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*
!data/.gitkeep

# Secrets — never committed (§11.4)
.env
*.key
secrets.yaml

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
